{"id":"n75832-1-8","stage":3,"title":"주간 · 一周","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n75832-1-8-1","ko":"이번 주는 날씨가 어떻대?","zh":"这周的天气怎么样啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이번","meaning":"这次，这回","explanation":"이번：这次，这回","readings":[{"term":"이번","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29737","senseId":"1","lemma":"이번","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"주는","meaning":"一周，一星期","explanation":"주：一周，一星期；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"주","audio":"/audio/6234d5b178a8b25809d8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26897","senseId":"1","lemma":"주","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"날씨가","meaning":"天气","explanation":"날씨：天气；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"날씨","audio":"/audio/fe655cf1d979cf3db76c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60630","senseId":"1","lemma":"날씨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어떻대?","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；대：口语中转述听来的话，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"da78d4146f0588e8","term":"이번","zh":"这次，这回","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3","entryId":"29737","definition":"马上到来的顺序；或指刚过去的顺序。","pronunciation":["이번"]},{"id":"6234d5b178a8b258","term":"주","zh":"一周，一星期","audio":"/audio/6234d5b178a8b25809d8.mp3","entryId":"26897","definition":"周一到周日的七天时间。","pronunciation":["주"]},{"id":"fe655cf1d979cf3d","term":"날씨","zh":"天气","audio":"/audio/fe655cf1d979cf3db76c.mp3","entryId":"60630","definition":"每天在气温或空气中出现的，如雨、云、风、雾等的状况。","pronunciation":["날씨"]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]}],"audio":"/audio/2c9caac50c4a17253a26.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n75832-1-8-2","ko":"나도 잘 모르겠는데. 주간 일기 예보를 확인해 볼게.","zh":"我也不太清楚呢。我先去看看每周的天气预报吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"나도","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"잘","meaning":"好好地，顺利地","explanation":"잘：好好地，顺利地","readings":[{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58939","senseId":"4","lemma":"잘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"모르겠는데.","meaning":"不知道，不认识，不懂","explanation":"모르다：不知道，不认识，不懂；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；는데：在句末提出背景、感想或含蓄的对照，留有后续语意；非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"모르다","audio":"/audio/20ef19694f337fd42539.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29712","senseId":"1","lemma":"모르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"주간","meaning":"一周","explanation":"주간：一周","readings":[{"term":"주간","audio":"/audio/2392bb5e3aa698e8c44b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75832","senseId":"1","lemma":"주간","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"일기","meaning":"天气","explanation":"일기：天气","readings":[{"term":"일기","audio":"/audio/6786dd1c77aabb011253.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70779","senseId":"1","lemma":"일기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"예보를","meaning":"预报","explanation":"예보：预报；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"예보","audio":"/audio/e42802dfc8235a4016cf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14141","senseId":"1","lemma":"예보","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"확인해","meaning":"确认，得知，查看","explanation":"확인하다：确认，得知，查看；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"확인하다","audio":"/audio/895c2bcd51e10cf1d30a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73237","senseId":"1","lemma":"확인하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"볼게.","meaning":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","explanation":"보다：试着做（-아/어 보다）；ㄹ게：向对方表达说话人的决定或承诺，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"25","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"8aff11a4aebdccdb","term":"잘","zh":"好好地，顺利地","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3","entryId":"58939","definition":"没有任何问题而舒服地。","pronunciation":["잘"]},{"id":"20ef19694f337fd4","term":"모르다","zh":"不知道，不认识，不懂","audio":"/audio/20ef19694f337fd42539.mp3","entryId":"29712","definition":"不清楚或不了解人或事物、事实等。","pronunciation":["모ː르다"]},{"id":"2392bb5e3aa698e8","term":"주간","zh":"一周","audio":"/audio/2392bb5e3aa698e8c44b.mp3","entryId":"75832","definition":"从星期一到星期日的一星期的时间。","pronunciation":["주간"]},{"id":"6786dd1c77aabb01","term":"일기","zh":"天气","audio":"/audio/6786dd1c77aabb011253.mp3","entryId":"70779","definition":"每天的气温、雨、云、风等空气中的状态。","pronunciation":["일기"]},{"id":"e42802dfc8235a40","term":"예보","zh":"预报","audio":"/audio/e42802dfc8235a4016cf.mp3","entryId":"14141","definition":"提前报道以后要发生的事；或指那样的报道。","pronunciation":["예ː보"]},{"id":"895c2bcd51e10cf1","term":"확인하다","zh":"确认，得知，查看","audio":"/audio/895c2bcd51e10cf1d30a.mp3","entryId":"73237","definition":"了解到或确定了确实是那样没错。","pronunciation":["화긴하다"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"61190","definition":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","pronunciation":["보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/50fd5acdce61e0ff274b.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.902,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=75832","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":104,"sequenceScore":2.7287,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["我也不太清楚呢。我先去看看每周的天气预报吧。","这周的天气怎么样啊？","你眼睛上怎么戴着眼罩啊？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["这周的天气怎么样啊？","你眼睛上怎么戴着眼罩啊？","我也不太清楚呢。我先去看看每周的天气预报吧。"],"answer":2}]}
